nlp\/multiple_choice", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/text_embedding", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/question_answer", "carriers": [ "pojo", "list" ] }, { "option": "application", "value": "audio", "carriers": [ "bytes", "stream", "file", "pojo" ] }, { "option": "application", "value": "timeseries\/forecasting", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.timeseries.TimeSeriesData" }, { "option": "application", "value": "tabular\/linear_regression", "carriers": [ "any" ] }, { "option": "application", "value": "tabular\/softmax_regression", "carriers": [ "any" ] } ], "description": "Depends on the application. The cv applications and audio take an image or audio clip as bytes, a stream, a File or a Path, or a DJL Image or Audio (a BufferedImage or a file name as text is not converted); cv\/image_generation an int[] of seeds. The nlp applications take a String only (bytes or a stream fail: convert to text first), nlp\/question_answer a QAInput or a String[] of the question and the paragraph, timeseries\/forecasting a TimeSeriesData. No body fails" },
    "producerOut": { "carriers": [ "pojo", "text", "list", "bytes" ], "byOption": [ { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/image_classification", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.Classifications" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/object_detection", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.cv.output.DetectedObjects" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/semantic_segmentation", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.cv.output.CategoryMask" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/instance_segmentation", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.cv.output.DetectedObjects" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/pose_estimation", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.cv.output.Joints" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/action_recognition", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.Classifications" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/word_recognition", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/image_generation", "carriers": [ "list" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.cv.Image[]" }, { "option": "application", "value": "cv\/image_enhancement", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.cv.Image" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/fill_mask", "carriers": [ "list" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String[]" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/question_answer", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/text_classification", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.Classifications" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/sentiment_analysis", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.Classifications" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/token_classification", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.modality.Classifications" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/word_embedding", "carriers": [ "bytes" ], "javaType": "byte[]" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/text_generation", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/machine_translation", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/multiple_choice", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "nlp\/text_embedding", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.ndarray.NDArray" }, { "option": "application", "value": "audio", "carriers": [ "text" ], "javaType": "java.lang.String" }, { "option": "application", "value": "timeseries\/forecasting", "carriers": [ "pojo" ], "javaType": "ai.djl.timeseries.Forecast" }, { "option": "application", "value": "tabular\/linear_regression", "carriers": [ "unknown" ] }, { "option": "application", "value": "tabular\/softmax_regression", "carriers": [ "unknown" ] } ], "description": "The prediction of the model, as a DJL object: Classifications, DetectedObjects, CategoryMask, Joints, an Image, an NDArray or a Forecast, or text for word_recognition, question_answer, text_generation, machine_translation, multiple_choice and audio; nlp\/word_embedding gives the encoded NDList as bytes. With a custom model, it is what its translator returns. The input the model took, such as the Image, is in the CamelDjlInput header" }
